{"overview":"چیهایا آیاسه بیشتر عمر خود را در حمایت از شغل مدل‌سازی خواهرش سپری کرده است. وقتی با پسری به نام آراتا واتایا ملاقات می‌کند، او فکر می‌کند چیهایا پتانسیل تبدیل شدن به بهترین بازیکن کاروتا در ژاپن را دارد. در حالی که چیهایا به‌دنبال تبدیل شدن به بهترین بازیکن کاروتا در ژاپن است، به‌سرعت از دوستان بازی‌کننده کاروتا جدا می‌شود. اکنون در دبیرستان، چیهایا هنوز کاروتا می‌نواخته و امیدوار است روزی دوباره با دوستانش ملاقات کند.","tagline":"","overview_en":"Chihaya Ayase has spent most of her life supporting her sister’s model career. When she meets a boy named Arata Wataya, he thinks Chihaya has potential to become a great karuta player. As Chihaya dreams of becoming Japan's best karuta player, she is soon separated from her karuta playing friends. Now in high school, Chihaya still plays karuta in the hope that she will one day meet her friends again.","tagline_en":"","runtime":23,"status":"Ended","seasons":[{"n":0,"name":"ویژه‌ها","ep":3,"y":2013,"poster":"/9BNowBgco3CNPBukJEWMuyXpm4O.jpg"},{"n":1,"name":"فصل 1","ep":25,"y":2011,"poster":"/lY6x2lZfEJTYtuC1JuU5u58aP4Z.jpg"},{"n":2,"name":"فصل 2","ep":25,"y":2013,"poster":"/htJqakjLo13NFXfvEnlB42VVPq8.jpg"},{"n":3,"name":"فصل 3","ep":24,"y":2019,"poster":"/eyz6vXSkTHTHAACoGwOZYeoB3yh.jpg"}],"episodes":74,"crew":[],"crew_en":[],"countries":["JP"],"cast":[{"name":"瀬戸麻沙美","role":"Chihaya Ayase (voice)","photo":"/iKKCPgKrNd4pJ0iBOC1SBZy2Y4Y.jpg","en":"Asami Seto"},{"name":"مامورو میانو","role":"Taichi Mashima (voice)","photo":"/nuok8ueG7k9hPZ09Tpr8e7Qn0ah.jpg","en":"Mamoru Miyano"},{"name":"細谷佳正","role":"Arata Wataya (voice)","photo":"/lUR5oN1LrqGgp25IOcI1qOH1Ud5.jpg","en":"Yoshimasa Hosoya"}],"trailer":"Y8U-E8hldHk","watch":{"US":{"link":"https://www.themoviedb.org/tv/45247/watch?locale=US","p":[{"n":"Crunchyroll","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/uFL3c4Cq8M6WoLymlC5Y8bmGytV.png"},{"n":"Crunchyroll Amazon Channel","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/qHLLmKo7udRgiSnIASVTwP2IxfJ.png"},{"n":"HiDive","kind":"flatrate","logo":"/1743zXk